{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "cosine-orconvqa", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "1-2_4", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Certainly. Here are some practical steps to strengthen your mental and emotional wellbeing:\n\n1. **Develop Healthy Daily Habits:** Focus on regular sleep, balanced nutrition, and physical activity. For example, consider adjusting your dinner time to earlier in the evening and prepare some meals at home to improve both physical and mental health.\n\n2. **Limit Screen Time:** Since you spend a lot of time on your phone, set specific periods to disconnect and use that time for other activities such as reading, journaling, or a short walk.\n\n3. **Social Connection:** Spend time with supportive friends or loved ones. Try to combine social activities with being active, such as joining a walking group or inviting someone for a hike.\n\n4. **Take Breaks and Practice Self-care:** Schedule short breaks during your day to relax, breathe deeply, or enjoy a hobby. Prioritizing enjoyable activities can boost your mood.\n\n5. **Seek Support:** If you feel overwhelmed, talk to a trusted person or a professional. Many mental health issues are treatable with the right help.\n\n6. **Avoid Unhelpful Habits:** Try to limit eating out, late-night meals, and avoid excessive alcohol or caffeine.\n\nImplementing small changes daily can build long-term positive habits for your mental wellbeing.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0029-77-12557:0": 28.600685119628906, "clueweb22-en0025-65-14045:4": 28.291240692138672, "clueweb22-en0005-96-08502:2": 28.1923828125, "clueweb22-en0036-54-12958:1": 27.934486389160156, "clueweb22-en0038-15-18890:10": 27.40975570678711, "clueweb22-en0001-06-07704:11": 26.15795135498047, "clueweb22-en0035-72-05083:5": 25.949018478393555, "clueweb22-en0008-72-05690:0": 25.87864112854004, "clueweb22-en0035-55-07566:11": 25.8605899810791, "clueweb22-en0041-46-02649:1": 25.795949935913086}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I eat dinner late at