{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "cosine-orconvqa", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "5-1_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Chia jam is a nutritious alternative to traditional jam, especially as it uses chia seeds, which are a good source of plant-based calcium, fiber, and omega-3 fatty acids. While chia seeds do contain calcium, the amount in a typical serving of chia jam will generally be lower than what you would get from a glass of milk. Milk is one of the richest sources of calcium, but if you prefer not to consume it, chia seeds can still help support your calcium intake.\n\nFor reference, a tablespoon of chia seeds provides a modest amount of calcium, but you would need to consume several tablespoons to approach the calcium content found in a glass of milk. However, by incorporating chia jam into your breakfasts regularly, along with other calcium-rich foods like leafy greens, nuts, or fortified alternatives, you can still support your calcium needs while enjoying a low-carb, healthier breakfast.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0022-86-10803:2": 55.229286193847656, "clueweb22-en0035-25-05618:2": 54.946353912353516, "clueweb22-en0022-53-06287:1": 54.92261505126953, "clueweb22-en0021-74-17714:11": 54.341575622558594, "clueweb22-en0016-62-07060:3": 53.6869010925293, "clueweb22-en0025-35-16754:4": 53.64850997924805, "clueweb22-en0021-94-19676:1": 53.2112922668457, "clueweb22-en0024-11-19374:3": 53.20830535888672, "clueweb22-en0004-78-11185:14": 52.93212127685547, "clueweb22-en0013-66-03912:4": 52.914398193359375}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I am interested in low-carb food.", "I eat jam for breakfast.", "I think I don't get enough calcium, and I am worried about it."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0022-86-10803:2": 55.229286193847656, "clueweb22-en0035-25-05618:2": 54.946353912353516, "clueweb22-en0022-53-06287:1": 54.92261505126953, "clueweb22-en0021-74-17714:11": 54.341575622558594, "clueweb22-en0016-62-07060:3": 53.6869010925293, "clueweb22-en00