{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "cosine-orconvqa", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "8-2_1", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "To get started with tattooing, begin by developing your artistic skills and creating a strong, diverse portfolio of designs. Next, build relationships with reputable tattoo artists\u2014spend time in their shops, show genuine interest in their work, and learn about the craft. Securing an apprenticeship with a certified tattoo artist is the widely accepted path; this will involve years of training, including equipment sterilization, design, biology, and infection prevention.\n\nBe prepared for hard work and menial tasks during your apprenticeship, as it is often unpaid and highly competitive. You will likely spend significant time practicing on non-human surfaces before progressing to real clients. Once you have gained practical skills, seek accreditation and register with your local council for the necessary license. Additionally, you may need vaccinations, such as hepatitis B, to comply with health regulations. \n\nPersistence and dedication are essential, as the journey to becoming a tattoo artist is challenging but rewarding.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0016-15-15694:2": 26.14834213256836, "clueweb22-en0016-15-15694:3": 25.636314392089844, "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:1": 25.265968322753906, "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:2": 24.954397201538086, "clueweb22-en0031-91-19741:4": 24.63731575012207, "clueweb22-en0015-05-03360:11": 24.620370864868164, "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:3": 24.50827407836914, "clueweb22-en0016-15-15694:1": 24.388233184814453, "clueweb22-en0007-71-06134:14": 24.21908187866211, "clueweb22-en0018-35-02125:19": 24.031879425048828}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I have a sealion tattoo on my left shoulder."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0016-15-15694:2": 26.14834213256836, "clueweb22-en0016-15-15694:3": 25.636314392089844, "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:1": 25.265968322753906, "clueweb22-en0028-52-08765:2": 24.9543972015